Decorator that converts a function into a filter::

    @simplefilter
    def lowercase(self, lexer, stream, options):
        for ttype, value in stream:
            yield ttype, value.lower()

Customize display of debugging messages while doing pattern matching:

- ``start_action`` - method to be called when an expression is about to be parsed;
  should have the signature ``fn(input_string: str, location: int, expression: ParserElement, cache_hit: bool)``

- ``success_action`` - method to be called when an expression has successfully parsed;
  should have the signature ``fn(input_string: str, start_location: int, end_location: int, expression: ParserELement, parsed_tokens: ParseResults, cache_hit: bool)``

- ``exception_action`` - method to be called when expression fails to parse;
  should have the signature ``fn(input_string: str, location: int, expression: ParserElement, exception: Exception, cache_hit: bool)``

Returns (direct_map, nested_map) shaped exactly for FilterToolbar:
  direct_map: { "X": [[label, [items]], ...], ... }
  nested_map: { "A": {"B": [[label, [items]], ...], ...}, ... }

Yield dict nodes that (appear to) represent a label item.

Accepts mixed shapes:
  - {"label": "...", "items": [...], "key": "...", "tipcfg": {...}, ...}
  - {"label": "...", ...}
  - ["Label", [...]]  (pair-shape)

Returns (direct_map, nested_map) shaped exactly for FilterToolbar:
  direct_map: { "X": [[label, [items]], ...], ... }
  nested_map: { "A": {"B": [[label, [items]], ...], ...}, ... }

Decorator that ensures the decorated function is not called more than once every `interval` seconds.

Usage:
    @throttle(0.1)
    def on_motion(event):
        ...

Decorator that postpones the execution of the decorated function until after `wait` seconds
have elapsed since the last call.

Usage:
    @debounce(0.2)
    def on_resize(event):
        ...
